  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">为<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a style=\"background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/productivebees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Productive Bees</a></span>添加模块化蜂箱</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ppgAfY3yF\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入Discord服务器</a></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1336/10/show.png\" alt=\"main\" width=\"769\" height=\"718\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">模块化蜂箱是一个3x3x3的结构。您可以使用任意蜂箱部件按需建造，以最大化生产效率。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1336/12/blocks.png\" alt=\"parts\" width=\"769\" height=\"673\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">它添加了强大的升级部件，通过其独特的机制来加速或改善蜂箱的生产。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1336/23/gui_alveary.png\" width=\"769\" height=\"723\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
